CHAPTER.VERS:
Therefore wait

          {+}
         for me, says Yahweh, until the day that I rise up to the prey; for my determination is to gather the nations, that I may assemble the kingdoms, to pour on them my indignation, even all my fierce anger; for all the earth will be devoured with the fire of my jealousy.

At that time I will bring you

          {+}
         in, at the time when I will gather you

          {+}
        ; for I will make you

          {+}
         a name and a praise among all the peoples of the earth, when I bring back your

          {+}
         captivity before your

          {+}
         eyes, says Yahweh.
